      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-24T05:09:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t know if I have whole albums in me for each character, so how about some individual songs for each hero?</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Absolute Zero</span><br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-s\">“Myxomatosis” - Radiohead</span> “Pink Houses” - John Cougar Mellencamp</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Haka</span><br>\n“Tubthumping” - Chumbawamba</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Expatriette</span><br>\n“Pistolero (Radio Edit)” - Juno Reactor</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Ra</span><br>\n“Bad Romance” - Lady Gaga</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Fanatic</span><br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-s\">“The Dead Flag Blues” - Godspeed You! Black Emperor</span> “Messiah” - Handel</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Bunker</span><br>\n“Story of my Life” - Social Distortion</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Mr. Fixer</span><br>\n“Get Rhythm” - Johnny Cash</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-i\">To be continued…?</span></p>",
