      "created_at": "2012-04-24T16:23:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only ones I’d disagree with are Absolute Zero and Fanatic. Fanatic almost definitely would only listen to hymns or Gregorian chants, and AZ is likely into the more morose classic rock songs, given his age. You hit the nail on the head with Mr. Fixer though, and HARD. Side note: The first time I told my roomate about Ra he sang that song, so now I can’t see him without hearing it.</p>",
