      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-25T22:42:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wraith Playlist!  All stuff that she would listen to, but also arranged to fit her origin story.  It’s kind of a slow start I know, but all good stuff.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Platforms by Ani Difranco</li>\n<li>In the Graveyard by Nina Nastasia</li>\n<li>Rough Cut by Amber Rubarth</li>\n<li>I’m No Heroine by Ani Difranco</li>\n<li>Apres Moi by Regina Spektor</li>\n<li>Wanted by Holly Black</li>\n<li>I’m Gonna Dance by Ayo</li>\n<li>A Mistake by Fiona Apple<br>\n9 Believe by K’s Choice</li>\n<li>It’s Amazing by Jem</li>\n<li>Trans Fatty Acid by Lamb</li>\n<li>Saving the Day by Brooke Fraser</li>\n</ol>",
